{
  "_doc": "Shared rule scenarios run by BOTH engines: game-server/test/scenarios.test.js (Node) and tests/php/scenarios.php (built-in PHP). A 24-block board (2 rows x 12). Steps: move, occupy, submit, release, advance (ms), spawnBoss, grab, bossSubmit, giveUp, give (item into deck), item (use slot), pause. Expect keys: ok, why, correct, pos {id:[r,c]}, solvedCount, solved [i], unsolved [i], occ {i: id|null}, boss (null|phase), deckSize {id:n} (penalty off, attacks off, so a boss win always gives one help item), ended.",
  "defaults": {
    "occMs": 30000,
    "bossWaitMs": 8000,
    "bossLimitMs": 30000,
    "limitMs": 300000,
    "penalty": false
  },
